":"Yes. Dr Maincy Jain is trained in minimally invasive laparoscopic gynaecological procedures including myomectomy and related surgeries."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When should I visit a gynaecologist?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For routine check-ups, pregnancy planning, antenatal care, irregular periods, pelvic pain, or any reproductive health concern — from adolescence through menopause."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I leave a review?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can share your experience on Practo or Google using the review links on this website."}}]}]</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__className_be8d20 __variable_30721a has-sticky-cta"><!--$--><header class="site-header  "><div class="site-announcement-wrap"><div class="announcement-bar"><div class="container d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><p class="announcement-text mb-0 text-center">15+ years experience · DNB OBGYN · Laparoscopic surgeon</p></div></div></div><div class="site-header-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div><nav class="site-nav" id="navbar" aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="container site-nav-inner"><a class="site-brand" href="/"><span class="site-brand-avatar-wrap"><img src="/images/about/portrait-desk.jpg" alt="Dr. Maincy Jain" class="site-brand-avatar"/></span><span class="site-brand-text"><span class="site-brand-name">Dr. Maincy</span><span class="site-brand-tag">Obstetrician · Gurugram</span></span></a><div class="site-nav-desktop"><ul class="site-nav-links"><li><a href="#heroBanner" class="site-nav-link">Home</a></li><li><a href="#about" class="site-nav-link">About</a></li><li><a href="#gallery" class="site-nav-link">Gallery</a></li><li><a href="#specialties" class="site-nav-link">Care</a></li><li><a href="#reviews" class="site-nav-link">Reviews</a></li><li><a href="#clinic" class="site-nav-link">Contact</a></li></ul><div class="site-nav-actio