-jain-obstetrics-gynecology\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Baani Square, G-104, Pocket C, South City II, Sector 50, Gurugram, Haryana 122018\",\"addressLocality\":\"Gurugram\",\"addressRegion\":\"Haryana\",\"postalCode\":\"122018\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"MedicalClinic\",\"name\":\"Healic Multispecialty Clinic, Baani Square\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Baani Square, G-104, Pocket C, South City II, Sector 50, Gurugram, Haryana 122018\",\"addressLocality\":\"Gurugram\",\"addressRegion\":\"Haryana\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.practo.com/gurgaon/doctor/maincy-jain-obstetrics-gynecology\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJiXTcMVIZDTkRFf_0z5lCSJ4\",\"https://www.healic.in/location/sector-50-gurugram\"]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is Dr Maincy Jain?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr Maincy Jain is an Obstetrician and Gynaecologist with 15+ years of experience, including 11 years as a specialist. She consults at Healic Multispecialty Clinic, Sector 50, Gurugram, and is DNB-qualified in Obstetrics \u0026 Gynaecology.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where does Dr Maincy Jain consult in Gurugram?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Primary consultations are at Healic Multispecialty Clinic, Baani Square, Sector 50, South City II, Gurugram. Deliveries and certain procedures may be at partner hospitals such as Kriti Hospital.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I book an appointment?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Call +91 95887 95887, send a WhatsApp message using the form on this website, or book directly via the Healic website for Sector 50, Gurugram.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is advance booking recommended?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Booking in advance helps secure a convenient slot. Walk-ins may be accommodated subject to availability.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What conditions does she treat?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Pregnancy and delivery care, high-risk obstetrics, laparoscopic gynaecology, infertility counselling, menstrual disorders, PCOS, fibroids, and general women's wellness screening.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does she perform laparoscopic surgery?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Dr Maincy Jain is trained in minimally invasive laparoscopic gynaecological procedures including myomectomy and related surgeries.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When should I visit a gynaecologist?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For routine check-ups, pregnancy planning, antenatal care, irregular periods, pelvic pain, or any reproductive health concern — from adolescence through menopause.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I leave a review?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can share your experience on Practo or Google using the review links on this website.\"}}]}]"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"15:{\"fontFamily\":\"system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,\\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\",\\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\"\",\"height\":\"100vh\",\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexDirection\":\"column\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}\n16:{\"display\":\"inline-block\",\"margin\":\"0 20px 0 0\",\"padding\":\"0 23px 0 0\",\"fontSize\":24,\"fontWeight\":500,\"verticalAlign\":\"top\",\"lineHeight\":\"49px\"}\n17:{\"display\":\"inline-block\"}\n18:{\"fontSize\":14,\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"49px\",\"margin\":0}\n1d:[]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"buildId\":\"7_MuugJnqI3zdcv4y3pju\",\"assetPrefix\":\"\",\"urlParts\":[\"\",\"_not-found\",\"\"],\"initialTree\":[\"\"